# The clipboard (D67). Whatever text was on the clipboard is put back at the
# end; where there is no clipboard to use, the test says so.
get clipboard into saved
copy "otter-net clipboard test" to clipboard
get clipboard into copied
if copied is "otter-net clipboard test"
    say "text went to the clipboard and back"
otherwise
    say "no clipboard to use here"
.
copy 42 to clipboard
get clipboard into number
if number is "42"
    say "a number is copied as its text"
.
if saved is gone
    copy "" to clipboard
otherwise
    copy saved to clipboard
.
say "clipboard restored"
